## Relationship to Other Techniques

| Technique | Calls | Decoding | Best for |
|---|---|---|---|
| Zero-shot | 1 | Greedy | Simple tasks |
| Few-shot CoT | 1 | Greedy | Reasoning, good accuracy needed |
| **Self-consistency** | **N (5–40)** | **Sampled** | **High-accuracy reasoning** |
| Self-consistency + Auto-CoT | N | Sampled | Pipeline scale, no hand-crafted examples |

Self-consistency sits on top of CoT — it's a decoding strategy, not a prompting structure change. You can layer it on any CoT setup.

